---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import welcome from "../assets/photos/welcome-neighbors.jpg";
import { agent, contactCta } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
  title="My Story | Scott Scharl — Keller Williams Metro"
  description="How Scott Scharl went from Troy to Phoenix real estate and back home to Royal Oak, now a REALTOR® with Keller Williams Metro."
>
  <section class="container-px mx-auto max-w-6xl pb-16 pt-28 sm:pb-24 sm:pt-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <img
        src={agent.photo}
        alt={agent.name}
        class="mx-auto h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-stone-100 object-cover shadow-lg shadow-black/10"
        width="128"
        height="128"
      />
      <h1 class="mt-8 text-center text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">My story</h1>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
        <p>
          I'm a REALTOR® with {agent.brokerage} in downtown Royal Oak. I was born in Royal Oak, grew up in Troy, and
          I'm back home in Metro Detroit for good.
        </p>
        <p>
          Real estate isn't new to me. From 2015 to 2019 I sold properties in the Phoenix area, working on
          everything from modest starter homes and condos to investor properties, rentals and million-dollar luxury.
          I moved back to Michigan in the fall of 2022, and my wife and I are now proud homeowners in Royal Oak,
          about two miles from the hospital where I was born. I've loved reconnecting with family and friends and
          seeing how much the area has grown.
        </p>
        <p>
          Real estate is a personal business, and I've always done my best work with people I share a connection
          with. I recently showed an investor property in Pontiac and a luxury apartment in Detroit's historic
          Broderick Tower back to back, at opposite ends of Woodward Avenue. Both clients turned out to have grown up
          within a mile and a half of me in Troy.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you read a puzzling market headline, need a good contractor, or just have a question,
          <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-brand underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand-dark"
            >contact me</a
          >. I'm always happy to help.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Where I learned</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-muted">
          St. Hugo, Brother Rice, and Hillsdale College
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-10 gap-y-6">
          <img src="/schools/st-hugo.png" alt="St. Hugo of the Hills Catholic School" class="h-24 w-auto mix-blend-multiply" width="220" height="220" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/schools/brother-rice.png" alt="Brother Rice High School" class="h-24 w-auto mix-blend-multiply" width="310" height="320" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/schools/hillsdale.svg" alt="Hillsdale College" class="h-12 w-auto" width="198" height="53" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="mt-14">
        <Picture
          src={welcome}
          formats={["avif", "webp"]}
          widths={[600, 900, 1400]}
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"
          alt="A hand-lettered “Welcome, Neighbors!” sign taped to a wooden post in a Royal Oak park"
          class="w-full rounded-2xl object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-sm text-muted">
          This summer my family and I hosted a food truck night for our neighbors. I'm blessed to be able to do these
          kinds of things!
          <a href="/contact?list=1" class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">Get invited to the next one →</a>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="mt-12 flex justify-center">
        <a
          href={contactCta.href}
          class="rounded-full bg-brand px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-brand/20 transition-colors hover:bg-brand-dark"
          >{contactCta.label}</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
